Package: serial-terminal
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.17), libgtk-3-0 (>= 3.12)
Maintainer: susmaz <susmaz@localhost>
Description: Simple GTK3 serial port terminal
 A simple serial port terminal for Linux built with GTK3 and Glade.
 It scans for serial ports, supports baud rates up to 921600, configurable
 data bits, parity, stop bits and flow control, hex receive/send mode,
 timestamps, auto-scroll, visible control-character display (\n, \r, ...),
 settings persistence and non-blocking transmit.
